      "cooked": "<p>Future self meet past self</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-328-writers-room-freedom-five-194-silver-age-time-travel-team-up\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-328-writers-room-freedom-five-194-silver-age-time-travel-team-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-328-writers-room-freedom-five-194-silver-age-time-travel-team-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #328 - Writers’ Room: Freedom Five #194 “Silver Age...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Gotta go back in time!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:50:47 We came in with barely a plan at all on this one, and then everything still changed... and yet! Somehow! We prevailed! What a tale. We hope you enjoy it as much as we do! Lots of interesting...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/6467fe8aa59d201577baf447336d07bddc66fa51.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/6467fe8aa59d201577baf447336d07bddc66fa51\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6467fe8aa59d201577baf447336d07bddc66fa51_2_325x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ekeykQPBuftcICxruoFOvWsQ5HP\" width=\"325\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6467fe8aa59d201577baf447336d07bddc66fa51_2_325x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6467fe8aa59d201577baf447336d07bddc66fa51_2_487x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6467fe8aa59d201577baf447336d07bddc66fa51_2_650x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"84675B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1331×2044 1.23 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
